    {
      "flavor_text": "ブリザードを　はっせいさせて　あたり\nいちめんを　まっしろに　してしまう。\nべつめい　アイスモンスター。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "블리자드를 발생시켜 주변\n일대를 새하얗게 만든다.\n별명은 아이스 몬스터다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "De larges zones sont recouvertes par la neige de ses\nblizzards. On l’appelle « monstre des glaces ».",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es bedeckt weite Gebiete mit Schnee, indem es\nBlizzards auslöst. Man nennt es „Das Eismonster“.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Genera ventiscas con las que cubre de nieve grandes\náreas. Se le llama el Monstruo de Hielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Crea bufere che ricoprono di neve ampissime aree.\nÈ noto anche come “Mostro dei ghiacci”.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up\nblizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ブリザードを　発生させて　あたり\n一面を　真っ白に　してしまう。\n別名　アイスモンスター。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Genera ventiscas con las que cubre de nieve grandes\náreas. Se le llama el Monstruo de Hielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まんねんゆきが　つもる　さんみゃくで\nしずかに　くらす。ブリザードを\nはっせいさせて　すがたを　かくす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "만년설이 쌓인 산맥에서\n조용히 지낸다. 블리자드를\n발생시켜 모습을 감춘다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il hante les sommets aux neiges éternelles, et se\ncache en déclenchant des blizzards.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es haust im Gebirge, wo ewiger Schnee liegt,\nund löst Blizzards aus, um sich zu verstecken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en paz en cordilleras de nieves eternas.\nGenera ventiscas para ocultarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nella pace delle cime montuose tra le nevi eterne:\nscatena bufere di neve e poi si nasconde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually\ncovered in snow. It hides itself by whipping\nup blizzards.",
